CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'unit_size == CCP_XTS_AES_UNIT_SIZE__LAST'
#280: FILE: drivers/crypto/ccp/ccp-crypto-aes-xts.c:148:
+	if ((unit_size == CCP_XTS_AES_UNIT_SIZE__LAST) ||
 	    (ctx->u.aes.key_len != AES_KEYSIZE_128)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

